{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/f210381f650ddef237499751b9c04846.poster.avif?t=1773948702\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/f210381f650ddef237499751b9c04846.webm?t=1773948702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/f210381f650ddef237499751b9c04846.mp4?t=1773948702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/2d665d055707f9ee8e6187c5f970092e.poster.avif?t=1773948702\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/2d665d055707f9ee8e6187c5f970092e.webm?t=1773948702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/2d665d055707f9ee8e6187c5f970092e.mp4?t=1773948702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to direct the liquid droplets, plasma particles, and laser beams into their corresponding containers. When all of the containers on a level are full, you have won the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are nine different types of puzzle pieces that you use to manipulate the flow of the droplets and lasers: drums, mirrors, and slides, and the various levels will provide you with different quantities of these puzzle pieces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0412esigned for hand tracking and controllers, the game takes the physics interactions to a whole new dimension with the new mechanics, including Gravetoids' gravity lenses, Plasma particles, Laser beams, Teleporters, Gravity Inverters, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/094115e6a289f891e1884d6d2cb4b1fe.poster.avif?t=1773948702\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/094115e6a289f891e1884d6d2cb4b1fe.webm?t=1773948702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/094115e6a289f891e1884d6d2cb4b1fe.mp4?t=1773948702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/484b381316b643e636147ae153887dec.poster.avif?t=1773948702\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/484b381316b643e636147ae153887dec.webm?t=1773948702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/extras/484b381316b643e636147ae153887dec.mp4?t=1773948702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/562770?t=1773948702","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/562770?t=1773948702","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/3e9a8e5b0997a3aa25955315ad25d934718fa622/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773948702","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562770/3e9a8e5b0997a3aa25955315ad25d934718fa622/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773948702","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"desc